:"def","line":225,"name":"MPN.WordArray.writeHalves","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN/Trim.lean#L225-L236"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Trim.html#MPN.WordArray.writeShr\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">WordArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">writeShr</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">A </span><span class=\"fn\">L</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">LA</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/LimbArray.html#MPN.LimbArray\">LimbArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <span class=\"fn\">A</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">o </span><span class=\"fn\">len </span><span class=\"fn\">v</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">A</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Writes `v % 2^(w len)` into the `len` limbs of `a` from `o` on: when a word holds two limbs or\nmore, `64 / w` limbs from each word of `v`, which `toUInt64` reads without an operation on `Nat`,\nand otherwise one limb at a time (`writeLimbs`), which writes a limb from `v` directly.","docLink":"./MPN/Trim.html#MPN.WordArray.writeShr","kind":"def","line":189,"name":"MPN.WordArray.writeShr","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN/Trim.lean#L189-L200"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"brea